      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MODELS TO DOWNLOAD\n\nAll files are from **Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4**.\n\n### Conditional diffusion model\n[\u2b07 ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors \u00b7 9.28 GB](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\nInstall to: ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/\n\n### Unconditional diffusion model\n[\u2b07 ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors \u00b7 9.28 GB](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\nInstall to: ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/\n\n### Text encoder\n[\u2b07 qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors \u00b7 10.59 GB](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\nInstall to: ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/\n\n### VAE\n[\u2b07 flux2-vae.safetensors \u00b7 0.34 GB](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\nInstall to: ComfyUI/models/vae/\n\nAfter placing the files, restart ComfyUI or refresh model lists with **R**.\n\n**Workflow graph:** 100% ComfyUI core nodes.\n\n**Apple Silicon runtime requirement:** [ComfyUI-AppleSilicon-FP8](https://github.com/pawel-mazurkiewicz/ComfyUI-AppleSilicon-FP8) plus **torch 2.11+**. See panel B for why."
      ],
      "title": "Models & downloads",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -540,
        80
      ],
      "size": [
        500,
        1000
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## RECIPE & MAC GOTCHAS\n\n**Official recipe:** euler \u00b7 Ideogram4Scheduler \u00b7 DualModelGuider cfg 7 \u00b7 CFGOverride 3.0 @ 0.7-1.0\n\n**Official presets:**\n- V4_QUALITY_48: steps 48, mu 0.0, std 1.50\n- V4_DEFAULT_20: steps 20, mu 0.0, std 1.75\n- V4_TURBO_12: steps 12, mu 0.5, std 1.75\n\nIdeogram states Quality 48 is its default. This workflow ships Default 20 as the practical Apple Silicon tier.\n\n**Dimensions:** change Ideogram4Scheduler width and height together with EmptyFlux2LatentImage. Dimensions must be multiples of 16. The official template snaps them with `max(((a + 15) // 16) * 16, 256)`.\n\n**fp8 is mandatory on Mac, not optional.** Comfy-Org ships Ideogram 4 only as fp8_scaled, int8_convrot and nvfp4. int8_convrot needs CUDA-only kernels; nvfp4 is an NVIDIA Blackwell format. So fp8 + the AppleSilicon-FP8 node is the only path that runs on Apple Silicon; there is no bf16 build to fall back to.\n\n**Measured memory:** on a 48 GB M-series with `--lowvram --disable-smart-memory` and models on an external SSD, peak was about **41 GB**, including about **14 GB** of macOS/app baseline. Ideogram 4 itself was roughly **27 GB at about 2 MP**.\n\n**Measured speed:** cost scales linearly with pixels at roughly **11.2 s/it per megapixel**. 1024x1024 is approximately 13 s/it, and 1088x1920 is approximately 26 s/it. V4_DEFAULT_20 at 1024x1024 takes about 4-5 minutes, plus a one-time model load of about 1-2 minutes.\n\n**MPS batch rule:** batch_size must stay **1**. Higher and only the first image denoises; the rest come out as static. Queue many separate jobs instead.\n\n**LoRA rule:** never set a LoRA to strength 0.0 on MPS; it NaNs to a pure black image. Bypass the node with **Ctrl+B** instead.\n\n**Prompt grammar:** the prompt must be a **JSON caption**, not prose. Ideogram 4 is out-of-distribution on plain text: worse output AND false-positive refusals (the model draws a flat gray blocked card). See **CAPTIONS.md** in the repo for the full grammar."
      ],
      "title": "Recipe & Mac gotchas",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
