        "{\"high_level_description\": \"A mid-century screen-printed travel poster of a red cable car crossing above jagged limestone peaks at sunrise, with the destination name set large across the lower third.\", \"style_description\": {\"aesthetics\": \"mid-century modern travel poster design, flat geometric shapes, clean hard-edged colour separations, generous negative space\", \"lighting\": \"low sunrise light raking across the peaks, long flat shadows rendered as solid shapes\", \"medium\": \"vintage screen print on textured poster paper, visible halftone grain, slight ink misregistration\", \"art_style\": \"1950s Alpine railway tourism poster, limited spot-colour palette, strong graphic silhouettes\", \"color_palette\": [\"#E8DCC4\", \"#D94F30\", \"#2B4C6F\", \"#8FB0C4\", \"#1A1A18\"]}, \"compositional_deconstruction\": {\"background\": \"a graduated sunrise sky in flat bands of pale cream and dusty rose behind layered mountain silhouettes in deep blue and slate, no watermark\", \"elements\": [{\"type\": \"obj\", \"bbox\": [180, 60, 620, 940], \"desc\": \"three angular limestone peaks in flat layered silhouette, a thin steel cable strung across the frame with a small red enclosed cable car hanging from it\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"bbox\": [650, 90, 790, 910], \"text\": \"DOLOMITI\", \"desc\": \"the single hero word in a heavy condensed geometric sans serif, all capitals, tightly letterspaced, deep blue ink, centred across the full width\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"bbox\": [800, 150, 850, 850], \"text\": \"ALTA BADIA \u00b7 SUDTIROL\", \"desc\": \"a thin all-capitals line in a light geometric sans, widely letterspaced, burnt orange ink, centred directly beneath the hero word\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"bbox\": [890, 300, 930, 700], \"text\": \"FUNIVIA DAL 1947\", \"desc\": \"very small all-capitals text in a light sans, widely letterspaced, dark slate ink, centred\"}]}}"
